		- and the shameless hack(tm) in qc.c with 0-1-lists
	- e.g. the INFLECTD is monotonic, '-' becomes '+'
		- this would help rule out applying inflectional rules like non3sg_fin_verb when 3sg_fin_verb is on the orth-agenda
		- might be lots of other such features we could find
	- auto pick packing restrictor
